# The VSIX ships two bundles, the static assets they need, and — in a
# platform-specific build — `toolchain/bin/d2`, `toolchain/bin/hmd-lsp`, and
# `toolchain/bin/hql` where HQL publishes the platform, from the pinned
# toolchain release (issue 0107), nothing else (HMD-0021, Packaging). README.md, CHANGELOG.md, and LICENSE stay: the marketplace
# renders the first two as its Details and Changelog tabs.

src/**
test/**
media/*.ts
node_modules/**
esbuild.mjs
syntaxes/*.mjs
syntaxes/*.py
syntaxes/languages.json
tsconfig.json
vitest.config.ts
**/*.map
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.vscodeignore

# Contributor-facing, and shipping it puts a build guide in front of a reader
# who installed a preview.
DEVELOP.md
.gitignore
*.vsix
